 The modified PSO method, named multi-stage linearly-decreasing weight (MLDW-PSO
), proved effective in both offline and online experiments, achieving an
 average accuracy of 76.67% for four-class emotion recognition and 89.5% in
 an online two-class emotion recognition system 
\begin_inset CommandInset citation
LatexCommand citep
key "key-13"
literal "false"

\end_inset

.
\end_layout

