The trials were combined into sessions of about 50-55 minutes each to ensure
 the participant did not become tired.
 The order of the film clips was arranged to avoid presenting two clips
 eliciting the same emotion consecutively, thereby maintaining the participant's
 engagement and ensuring the effectiveness of emotion induction.
\end_layout

