\begin_layout Itemize

\series bold
EEG Channels:
\series default
 The headset has 14 channels positioned at AF3, F7, F3, FC5, T7, P7, O1,
 O2, P8, T8, FC6, F4, F8, and AF4.
 These channels correspond to standard 10-20 system placements, ensuring
 comprehensive coverage of the scalp for effective data collection.
\end_layout

