\begin_layout Subsection
Data Loading
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
The SEED dataset is utilized to train the model.
 The loading process includes the following steps:
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize

\series bold
File Processing:
\series default
 Each file is parsed to extract subject number, trial number, and EEG data.
