\begin_layout Standard
Despite the advancements achieved, this study faced several limitations:
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize

\series bold
Dataset Quality:
\series default
 The inherent difficulty in creating a high-quality dataset led to lower
 accuracy due to remaining artifacts in the data, despite extensive preprocessin
g efforts.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize

\series bold
GAN Training Challenges:
\series default
 The discriminator often trained faster than the generator, hindering the
 overall performance of the GAN and complicating the training process.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize

\series bold
Overfitting Risks:
\series default
 The potential for overfitting, especially during fine-tuning, affected
 the model's ability to generalize effectively, as indicated by fluctuations
 in evaluation loss and accuracy.
\end_layout

